\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{// \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{// \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} lettura dati dal sensore SHT20 \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{// \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}

\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+cm}{/**}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * @brief Gestione del sensore SHT20.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * Come illustrato nella classe sht20, per leggere le misurazioni del}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * sensore SHT20 è necessario invocare ripetutamente la funzione update()}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * fino a quando non restituisce true. Tale funzione si occupa di gestire}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * in autonomia le fasi di richiesta, attesa e lettura dei dati dal sensore.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * Se la funzione update() restituisce false, significa che le misurazioni}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * non sono ancora disponibili o che si è verificato un errore. Va quindi}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * verificata la presenza di eventuali errori con la funzione get\PYGZus{}error().}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * Quando la funzione update() restituisce true, significa che le nuove}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * misurazioni sono disponibili e vanno lette entrambe tramite le funzioni}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * get\PYGZus{}temperature() e get\PYGZus{}humidity(), altrimenti non è possibile effettuare}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * la richiesta di nuove misurazioni.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * All\PYGZsq{}arrivo di nuove misurazioni si effettuano le seguenti operazioni:}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * 1. lettura della temperatura e dell\PYGZsq{}umidità (in float) e conversione}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *    dei valori in interi a 4 cifre}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * 2. verifica di eventuali overflow dei valori e salvataggio dei valori}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *    nella struct status}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * 3. gestione degli attuatori se in modalità automatica}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * 4. stampa di log sullo stato dell\PYGZsq{}incubatrice su serial monitor}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * La gestione degli attuatori dipende dal tipo di controllo selezionato:}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * \PYGZhy{} per i controllori ad isteresi ON/OFF, si verifica se la differenza tra}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *   il setpoint e la misurazione supera la soglia di isteresi, modificando}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *   di conseguenza lo stato degli attuatori}
\PYG{c+cm}{   * \PYGZhy{} per i controllori PID, si aggiungono i nuovi dati al controllore con}
\PYG{c+cm}{   *   la funzione pid\PYGZus{}add\PYGZus{}data().}
\PYG{c+cm}{   */}

\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{c+c1}{// aggiorna il sensore e verifica la presenza di nuovi dati}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{o}{!}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{update}\PYG{p}{())}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// verifica presenza di nuovi errori nel sensore SHT20}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{get\PYGZus{}error}\PYG{p}{())}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{serial\PYGZus{}sht20\PYGZus{}error}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{get\PYGZus{}error}\PYG{p}{());}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{// stampa errore su serial monitor}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{lcd\PYGZus{}sht20\PYGZus{}error}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{get\PYGZus{}error}\PYG{p}{());}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{// stampa errore su display lcd}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}set}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}SHT20}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{// impostazione bit di errore per il sensore SHT20}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{else}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}

\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// 1.a lettura della temperatura e conversione in intero a 4 cifre}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{k+kt}{int16\PYGZus{}t}\PYG{p}{)(}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{get\PYGZus{}temperature}\PYG{p}{()}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{*}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{100}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{+}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mf}{0.5}\PYG{p}{);}

\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// 2.a verifica overflow della temperatura e gestione errori}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZlt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{0}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{        }\PYG{c+c1}{// verifica temperatura negativa}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}set}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}TEMP\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} impostazione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{0}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} assegnazione valore minimo}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{else}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{9999}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{// verifica temperatura troppo alta}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}set}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}TEMP\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{   }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} impostazione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{9999}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{     }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} assegnazione valore massimo}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{else}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{                             }\PYG{c+c1}{// temperatura valida}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}clear}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}TEMP\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{       }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} rimozione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} salvataggio valore}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}

\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// 1.b lettura dell\PYGZsq{}umidità e conversione in intero a 4 cifre}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{k+kt}{int16\PYGZus{}t}\PYG{p}{)(}\PYG{n}{sensor}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{get\PYGZus{}humidity}\PYG{p}{()}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{*}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{100}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{+}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mf}{0.5}\PYG{p}{);}

\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// 2.b verifica overflow dell\PYGZsq{}umidità e gestione errori}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZlt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{0}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+c1}{// verifica umidità negativa}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}set}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}RH\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} impostazione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{0}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} assegnazione valore minimo}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{else}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{9999}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{// verifica umidità troppo alta}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}set}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}RH\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{     }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} impostazione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+m+mi}{9999}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{       }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} assegnazione valore massimo}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{else}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}\PYG{+w}{                           }\PYG{c+c1}{// umidità valida}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{err\PYGZus{}clear}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{ERR\PYGZus{}RH\PYGZus{}OVERFLOW}\PYG{p}{);}\PYG{+w}{       }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} rimozione bit di errore}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{=}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{sensor\PYGZus{}read}\PYG{p}{;}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{c+c1}{//  \PYGZhy{} salvataggio valore}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{p}{\PYGZcb{}}

\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{c+c1}{// 3. controllo degli attuatori se in modalità automatica}
\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{k}{if}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{o}{!}\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{manual\PYGZus{}ctrl}\PYG{p}{)}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p}{\PYGZob{}}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+cp}{\PYGZsh{}if TEMP\PYGZus{}CTRL == HYST }\PYG{c+c1}{// controllo ad isteresi ON/OFF della temperatura}
\PYG{+w}{        }\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}hyst\PYGZus{}ctrl}\PYG{p}{();}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+cp}{\PYGZsh{}elif TEMP\PYGZus{}CTRL == PID }\PYG{c+c1}{// controllo tramite PID della temperatura}
\PYG{+w}{        }\PYG{n}{pid\PYGZus{}add\PYGZus{}data}\PYG{o}{\PYGZlt{}}\PYG{n}{TEMP}\PYG{o}{\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}pid}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}setpoint}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{p}{);}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+cp}{\PYGZsh{}endif}

\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+cp}{\PYGZsh{}if RH\PYGZus{}CTRL == HYST }\PYG{c+c1}{// controllo ad isteresi ON/OFF dell\PYGZsq{}umidità}
\PYG{+w}{        }\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}hyst\PYGZus{}ctrl}\PYG{p}{();}
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{c+cp}{\PYGZsh{}elif RH\PYGZus{}CTRL == PID }\PYG{c+c1}{// controllo tramite PID dell\PYGZsq{}umidità}
\PYG{+w}{        }\PYG{n}{pid\PYGZus{}add\PYGZus{}data}\PYG{o}{\PYGZlt{}}\PYG{n}{RH}\PYG{o}{\PYGZgt{}}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}pid}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}setpoint}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{o}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}at\PYGZus{}temp\PYGZus{}setpoint}\PYG{p}{(}\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{p}{,}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{temp\PYGZus{}setpoint}\PYG{p}{),}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n}{status}\PYG{p}{.}\PYG{n}{rh\PYGZus{}sht20}\PYG{p}{);}
